extends ../layout
include ../partials/field

block content
  section.band.page.page-narrow
    h1 Set up two step sign in
    p.lede Add the secret below to an authenticator app, then enter the code it shows to confirm it works.

    dl.terms
      div
        dt Account
        dd Marchmont
      div
        dt Secret
        dd
          code.secret= secret

    p.note If your app can scan a code, it can also take this address directly:
    p.note
      code.secret= uri

    form.stack(method="post" action="/account/two-factor" novalidate)
      input(type="hidden" name="_csrf" value=csrfToken)
      input(type="hidden" name="secret" value=secret)
      +field("code", "Code from your app", { inputmode: "numeric", autocomplete: "one-time-code", required: true, autofocus: true })
      .button-row
        button.button(type="submit") Turn on two step sign in
        a.button.button-quiet(href="/account") Cancel
    p.note Nothing changes until the code is accepted, so a mistyped secret cannot lock you out.
